    "detailed_description": "We are excited to introduce our new puzzle game in the hidden object genre.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853400/extras/2a3f15299b2a8bcabc79f9b211988b11.poster.avif?t=1750267493\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853400/extras/2a3f15299b2a8bcabc79f9b211988b11.webm?t=1750267493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853400/extras/2a3f15299b2a8bcabc79f9b211988b11.mp4?t=1750267493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your task is to find all the cats in the location. You can rotate/zoom the scene and interact with the environment to find all the hidden animals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853400/extras/64918d292d9faad9a17e5509ade24dc2.poster.avif?t=1750267493\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853400/extras/64918d292d9faad9a17e5509ade24dc2.webm?t=1750267493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853400/extras/64918d292d9faad9a17e5509ade24dc2.mp4?t=1750267493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:<br><br>- over 100 hidden cats <br>- 5 different locations<br>- simple puzzles",
